    "title": "Son of Bond Hill shooting victim seeks justice after father's death - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brittany Harry ,\n8 hours ago CINCINNATI (WXIX) - The son of a man shot and killed in Bond Hill says he wants justice to be served. Cincinnati police were called to the 1500 block of Yarmouth Avenue for a report of a person shot just before 12 a.m. Tuesday. Police say they found 40-year-old Aaron Rosemond with gunshot wounds. He was pronounced dead at the scene. Read full article\n1",
